[Quotes]
victory0 = "I've saved the city, saved the girl, but couldn't save myself..."
victory1 = "After waiting so long, it feels good to do more than two moves!"
victory2 = "The world is full of bad guys! I have so much work ahead of me!"
victory3 = "I don't care if you're human, beast or car! I'll take you on!"
victory4 = "I've got a lot of time on my hands. How about a rematch?"
victory5 = "C'mon! Stand up! Don't let me down!"
victory6 = "With so much riding on my fists, this will not be my final fight!"
victory7 = "Just remember! This could happen to you again! And again!!"
victory8 = "You sure you wanna be goin' around startin' fights with guys like me?"
victory9 = "The only thing that doesn't change is the excitement of the fight."
victory10 = "I prefer my fights quick an' easy."
victory11 = "This is gettin' boring. Maybe I oughta head home."
victory12 = "A fighter that goes down that easy ain't worth a thing. Beat it!"
victory13 = "Fighting like this brings back lots of memories."
victory14 = "*sigh*"

;Adon
victory15 = "How do you have time to train between all those bouts of braggin' yourself up?"

;Akuma/Gouki
victory16 = "I thought you were s'posed to be way stronger than that. What happened?"
victory17 = "I don't need to follow some path or anything. I got my fists to get me through."

;Alex
victory18 = "You hit like a truck, but youve still got a lot to learn."

;Balrog/Bison/Boxer
victory19 = "I ain't about to get beat by a classless chump like you! No way, no how!"
victory20 = "You may be a pro boxer, but I fought thugs on the street that packed more of a punch than you."

;Birdie
victory21 = "Chains, huh? I'm no stranger to restraints myself."

;Blanka
victory22 = "I ain't here to fight animals. Just buzz off an' I'll leave ya alone."
victory23 = "Jeez, you're pretty wild, huh? Not that I'm complainin'--I'm all for fightin' crazy too."

;C. Viper
victory24 = "Calm down, lady. I ain't your target."

;Cammy
victory25 = "I thought you'd be a pushover, but you pulled off some impressive moves."

;Chun-Li
victory26 = "I did my time and paid my dues, so you're gonna get off my back, right?"

;Cody
victory27 = "That was a pretty good scrap. If you're gonna fight, you gotta be serious about it."
victory28 = "So this is what I was like back then, huh?"

;Dan
victory29 = "You're all talk, man! Anyone ever tell you that before?"

;DeeJay
victory30 = "If you fight this bad, I'd hate to hear your music!"

;Dhalsim
victory31 = "If your god is real, couldn't he just make it rain on your village?"
victory32 = "Yeah, yeah, I know you're enlightened and all, but that's not for me--I'm a brawler through and through."
 
;Dudley
victory33 = "If you put half as much energy into the fight as you do moustache grooming..."
 
;E.Honda
victory34 = "Not interested in whatever it is you're sellin', fat boy. Beat it."
victory35 = "Japan was built on fighting, huh? I kinda like the sound of that."

;Elena
victory36 = "Dancing? Friends? Not my style, kid. Happy to fight again any time, though."

;Evil Ryu/Kage
victory37 = "I'd hate to get on your bad side."
victory38 = "You wanna kill me? Fine. Next time try a bit harder, though."

;Fei-Long
victory39 = "Nice moves, but too flashy. You'd get eaten alive in Metro City, man."

;Gen
victory40 = "Watch out for karma, man. Things have a funny way of workin' themselves out..."
 
;Gouken
victory41 = "Sorry pal, but I'm sick of takin' advice from my elders. Beat it."
 
;Guile/Charlie Nash (SFA)
victory42 = "Scrappin' with a soldier isn't gonna look good in my records, but whatever. Totally worth it."
 
;Guy
victory43 = "Look, man. People change. I've changed. You've changed. That's the way it is."
victory44 = "What happened, man? You got pretty weak. What've you been doin' all this time?"

;Hugo
victory45 = "Hitting you reminds me of old times... Bah! Can't let myself get nostalgic."
 
;Ibuki
victory46 = "If you wanna fight, come at me for real. I ain't interested in kids' games."
victory47 = "A ninja schoolgirl, huh? I'd stick to school if I were you. You'll end up like me if you don't."
 
;Karin
victory48 = "So a spoiled brat like you's fightin' for fun, huh? Guess me and you got more in common than I thought."
 
;Ken Masters
victory49 = "Take it down a notch, man. It's just a fight."
 
;M.Bison/Vega/Dictator
victory50 = "I don't consider myself a good guy anymore, but I had to take you down!"
victory51 = "There's no point messin' up that mug of yours. I'll just come off lookin' like some sort of hero."
 
;Makoto
victory52 = "Not bad, but you need to deviate from the textbook if you really wanna win."
 
;Shin Akuma/Oni
victory53 = "Haha, getting into a scrap with a dude like you makes this world worth living in!"
 
;Rose
victory54 = "If you can change the future, what's the point of seein' it?"

;R.Mika
victory55 = "Sorry, but I'm more at home on the streets than on some flashy stage." 

;Ryu
victory56 = "I enjoy a serious fight now and then. That was fun!"
victory57 = "I see you haven't changed at all. You're still a real straight-laced fighter."
 
;Sagat
victory58 = "I didn't expect much, but you turned out to be one heckuva fighter."
victory59 = "Hmph, be serious. Who needs 'paths' when a fight will do?"
 
;Sakura
victory60 = "Not bad for a wannabe. In a few more years, you'll be a real contender."
 
;T.Hawk
victory61 = "Don't let me stand in your way if you got stuff to do. Good luck!"

;Vega/Balrog/Claw
victory62 = "I'm sick of your mouth, man. Get away from me before I start punchin' again!"
victory63 = "You keep runnin' your mouth about beauty this and beauty that, but there's nothin' beautiful about losin', right?"

;Yang
victory64 = "I don't need a reason to fight, pal. I just do it because I love it."

;Yun
victory65 = "I ain't looking to scrap with some punk kid. Get outta my face."

;Zangief
victory66 = "I'm used to beatin' up big guys like you. You leave yourself wide open!"
victory67 = "I used to know a real bruiser like you. He was a pretty good pro wrestler for an old man."

;Joe (Street Fighter 1)
victory68 = "Gee. I never though I'd have a copycat..."

;Charlie Nash (SFV)
victory69 = "Man, you're all gloom 'n' doom, aren't ya? I mean, I'm no ray of sunshine myself, but damn..."